    "CAT-Q"
  ],
  "description": "Repairs r-cat-1b/qd-members-builtin, tabledef-members-ddl and field-members-builtin: the opens were read-only, so QueryDef.Updatable, TableDef.Updatable and Field.DataUpdatable read 0 and could not show persisted updatability. On writable opens: r-cat-1b-qd's saved select QSel and update QUpd are each read for Name, DateCreated, LastUpdated, MaxRecords, ODBCTimeout, CacheSize, Prepare, StillExecuting, RecordsAffected, Connect, Type, ReturnsRecords, Updatable; then r-cat-1b-props' TableDef TP is read for Updatable and each of its Fields (up to 16) for Name, Type, Size, Attributes, OrdinalPosition, Required, AllowZeroLength, CollatingOrder, SourceField, SourceTable, DataUpdatable. (The pass-through QPass is left out: it needs an ODBC connect string.)",
  "callerSurface": "native-idispatch/x64",
  "invokeLcid": 1033,
  "observationRecipe": [
    "clearErrorInfoBefore",
    "excepinfo",
    "deferredFill",
    "errorInfo"
  ],
  "pathBinding": "attempt-local-copy",
